  "text": "Next, the host sends your prompt along with that tool catalog to the language model. Here is a critical detail: the language model never touches Slack or Notion directly. Instead, it reasons over your request and replies to the host with a structured decision saying: call the Slack search tool on the feedback channel, filtered for urgent customer items.",
